- if @invite.inviting_user.present?
  %h2="#{@invite.inviting_user.username} has invited you to Nitrous.IO"
  %p= "#{@invite.inviting_user.username} has invited you to Nitrous.IO"

- elsif @invite.created_at < 1.months.ago
  %h2 Your Nitrous.IO (formerly Action.IO) Invite Request
  %p Finally, your invite has arrived! We know you signed up for an invite quite a long time ago, and we apologize for the wait!

- else
  %h2 Your Nitrous.IO (formerly Action.IO) Invite Request
  %p We're sending you this email because you requested an invite on our website (www.nitrous.io).

%p Nitrous.IO is a cloud development platform that provides a lightning fast way to setup and manage development environments in the cloud. Please click the following link to activate your account:

:ruby
  _reg_url = new_user_registration_url(email: @invite.email, invite_code: @invite.invite_code)

%p=link_to _reg_url, _reg_url

%p Want some reasons why you should sign up?

%ul
  %li Web IDE so you can code from anywhere
  %li Support for Ruby/Rails, Python/Django, Node.JS and Go
  %li SSH into your box and use Vim or Emacs
  %li Development boxes are free for our private beta

%p We're currently in private beta, so please don't hesitate to get in touch with feedback.

%p
  The Nitrous.IO Team
  %br
  = link_to "https://www.nitrous.io/", "https://www.nitrous.io/"

%p
  P.S. We are
  = link_to('hiring in San Francisco!', jobs_url)

= mixpanel_pixel_track 'Invite Received', @invite.email
